   "title": "Rooms | Corsewall Lighthouse Hotel Accommodation",
   "text": "-->\nRooms | Corsewall Lighthouse Hotel Accommodation\ntop of page\nAccommodation at the lighthouse\nWith just eleven rooms spread across the former keepers’ quarters and additional buildings within the grounds, Corsewall offers a stay that feels both intimate and expansive. Every room has its own character, but all share the same sense of quiet, sea air and space to slow down.\nOur Accommodation Types\nKeepers Quarters\nHistoric, cosy rooms in the original lighthouse keepers’ quarters, including Fulmar, Galloway, Ailsa, Dunskirkloch, Mull of Kintyre and Firth of Cromarty.\nView Rooms\nPrivate Suites\nSpacious, modern suites set a short walk from the hotel, offering privacy, room to unwind and all the comfort you need for a longer stay. Ballantrae Suite and Lighthouse Suite\nExplore Suites\nStevenson Rooms\nRefurbished modern rooms a short walk from the hotel, all with sea views and access to a large lounge, ideal for small groups and families to stay together.\nSee Rooms <animate data-animate-id=\"animateBackward\" data-testid=\"animate-tag-backward\" begin=\"indefinite\" dur=\"0.2s\" calcMode=\"spline\" keyTimes=\"0; 1\" keySplines=\"0.65 0 0.35 1\" repeatCount=\"1\" attributeName=\"d\" from=\"M177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.6 L177.7,22.5 L177.7,22.5 L177.7,22.5 L177.7,22.5 L177.7,22.5 L177.7,22.5 L177.7,22.5 L177.